This file covers the two pieces of third-party analysis data this repository
carries for Polish, both taken from Apache Lucene's lucene-analysis-stempel
jar (version 10.2.1):

  src/analysis/stemmer_20000.tbl
      the Stempel stemmer table, from
      org/apache/lucene/analysis/pl/stemmer_20000.tbl.
      Built by the Egothor project (http://egothor.sf.net/) and covered by
      the Egothor Software License, below.

  src/analysis/polish_stopwords.txt
      the Polish stop word list, from
      org/apache/lucene/analysis/pl/stopwords.txt.
      Created by the Carrot2 project (https://github.com/carrot2/carrot2) and
      covered by the BSD license (https://project.carrot2.org/license.html).

